THIRD-PARTY CONTENT -- NOT COVERED BY THE PROJECT'S AGPL LICENCE
================================================================

The 296 .cube files in this directory and its subdirectories are third-party
data redistributed with this project. They are not the work of the Film Grain
Engine authors and the repository's AGPL-3.0 licence does not apply to them.


WHAT THEY ARE
-------------

Pat David's film emulation presets for G'MIC, converted from HaldCLUT images to
the .cube 3D LUT format. They approximate the colour response of photographic
film stocks and are organised here by the upstream categories:

    bw/                 25   black and white
    colorslide/         26   colour reversal / slide
    fujixtransiii/      15   Fujifilm X-Trans III camera simulations
    instant_consumer/   54   consumer instant film
    instant_pro/        68   professional instant film
    negative_color/     13   colour negative
    negative_new/       39   colour negative, current stocks
    negative_old/       44   colour negative, discontinued stocks
    print/              12   print film


