    Distributed with G'MIC (GREYC's Magic for Image Computing)
    https://gmic.eu/color_presets/

    Licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0

The wider G'MIC colour preset collection draws on several contributors
including RawTherapee's Creative Pack, Marc Roovers' PictureFX, the PIXLS.US
community, Stuart Sowerby and Juan Melara. The subset redistributed here is
Pat David's film emulation set. Full attribution for the whole collection is
listed at https://gmic.eu/color_presets/


TRADEMARKS
----------

The filenames reference film stocks and camera systems -- Agfa, Fujifilm,
Kodak, Polaroid and others -- whose names are trademarks of their respective
owners. Those names appear for the sole purpose of identifying which film stock
a given LUT approximates. Neither this project nor the upstream authors are
affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by any of those companies, and no
claim is made to any of those marks. This mirrors the disclaimer carried
upstream at https://gmic.eu/color_presets/


IF YOU REDISTRIBUTE THIS FOLDER
-------------------------------

CC BY-SA requires the credit above and a link to the licence to travel with the
data. Keep this file alongside the .cube files. build.sh copies it into the
distribution for exactly that reason -- do not filter it out when changing the
LUT copy step.
